gy to accurately capture every beat of your heart, just like professional medical equipment. Whether you need to understand your heart's basic rhythm at rest in the morning or track your heart rate changes in real time during exercise to effectively manage your exercise intensity, it's perfectly suited to your needs, providing a solid foundation for your heart health. The blood pressure tracking function is equally convenient and powerful. With just a few simple steps, every blood pressure reading is fully recorded. More importantly, the app analyzes this data and generates clear, intuitive charts, allowing you to clearly see your blood pressure fluctuations. This helps you gain accurate insights into your blood pressure status, allowing you to make timely lifestyle adjustments or better communicate with your doctor based on the data for better treatment.\n\nA Treasure of Knowledge, Nourishing a Healthy Life\n\nIn addition to its practical monitoring features, the app also boasts a vast library of high-quality health articles. The articles are rich and diverse, covering information on blood pressure, heart rate, and more. Whether you're looking to avoid illness, improve your fitness, or simply have questions about your health, you'll find satisfying answers here.\n\nPulse Monitor-Blood Sugar seamlessly integrates precise monitoring with extensive knowledge resources, striving to be your pocket health management expert. It's available anytime, anywhere, providing attentive service. Don't hesitate! Download Pulse Monitor-Blood Sugar now and let it accompany you on your journey to a healthier, more fulfilling life. Together, we embrace a healthier and brighter future.", "minimumOsVersion": "14.0", "contentAdvisoryRating": "12+", "trackCensoredName": "Pulse Monitor-Blood Sugar", "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/kr/app/pulse-monitor-blood-sugar/id6749566371?uo=4", "averageUserRating": 0, "releaseDate": "2025-08-10T07:00:00Z", "userRatingCount": 0}]}